cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or evaluation pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "Passive Bot Guard (SIH1672): Privacy-Preserving Passive Behavioural Bot Detection"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kpcode11/MajorProject-New"
authors:
  - family-names: "Prajapati"
    given-names: "Keshav"
abstract: >-
  A privacy-preserving passive behavioural bot detection prototype developed for
  Smart India Hackathon Problem Statement SIH1672. Combines leakage-free mouse
  kinematics (120 features, LightGBM + ONNX) and text-agnostic keystroke timing
  (31 features, key-class only) with 13 deterministic browser-environment rules
  (R01-R13), client-side feature extraction, WCAG 2.1 AA accessible step-up
  verification, and missing-modality fairness.
keywords:
  - bot-detection
  - passive-captcha
  - behavioral-biometrics-alternative
  - mouse-dynamics
  - keystroke-dynamics
  - privacy-preserving
  - accessibility
  - onnx
  - fastapi
  - sih1672
